---
// Bagian 4: Foto gedung
---
<section class="foto"><span class="reveal">SMK Al-Ittihad</span></section>
<style>
  .foto{height:70vh;min-height:380px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.05),rgba(0,0,0,.35)),url('/images/gedung.jpg') center/cover}
  span{
    font-family:'Italiana',serif;
    font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,44px);
    padding:30px;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    transition:
      opacity 1.15s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      transform 1.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      filter 1.15s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      letter-spacing 1.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  span.active{
    letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    span { letter-spacing: 1px; }
  }
</style>
